<td Valign=top><font face="garamond" size=3 color=#fdbc44><b>New Bazaar Trading Interface
</font><br><br></b><font face="garamond" size=3 color="#ffe4b5">Finally got into the Test Server for more than a minute, its really buggy and keeps booting me to the desktop.  Apparently every time they update test my skins that I have created no longer work.<br><br>The Bazaar interface looks fairly interesting, Character that make themselves a Merchant will have Trader in front of their name.  The bazaar window has a search function which can find what you are looking for.  Once you know what you want and the name of the person selling it, you go find them, right click like any other NPC merchant and you can buy what you like.<br><br>Here is a picture of me buying a throwing boulder.  The prices on test are MUCH different than on the live servers, yes someone was actually selling KEI for 800pp.<br><br><a href="http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/bazaar.jpg"><img src="http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/bazaar.jpg" width=300></a>
<Font face="Garamond" size=1 color="#ffffff"><b><br><br>-<a href=main.cgi?fetch=BREE>BREE
</a><br>
