<td Valign=top><font face="garamond" size=3 color=#fdbc44><b>Grieg's End
</font><br><br></b><font face="garamond" size=3 color="#ffe4b5">Here are some pics from our short adventure in grieg's end.  Interesting enough the mobs appear to be one thing to you, however they appear to be something else to others.  For example, one person viewed the mob as a beetle and another person sees it as an owlbear, it is different for each group member.<br><br>The mobs also turn the people in your group into different models, here are some pictures:<br><br><A HREF=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge1.jpg target=new><img src=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge1.jpg border=0 width=155></A><A HREF=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge2.jpg target=new><img src=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge2.jpg border=0 width=155></A><A HREF=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge3.jpg target=new><img src=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge3.jpg border=0 width=155></A><br><br><br><A HREF=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge4.jpg target=new><img src=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge4.jpg border=0 width=155></A><A HREF=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge5.jpg target=new><img src=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge5.jpg border=0 width=155></A><A HREF=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge6.jpg target=new><img src=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge6.jpg border=0 width=155></A><br><br><br><A HREF=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge7.jpg target=new><img src=http://www.blushn.com/&#126;blush/mod/pics/ge/ge7.jpg border=0 width=155></A>
